### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083

### 1. Register a Doctor (General Medicine)
# @name registerDoctor1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "licenseNumber": "MD-NY-10293",
  "firstName": "Gregory",
  "lastName": "House",
  "specialty": "GENERAL_MEDICINE",
  "email": "house@hospital.com",
  "phone": "+16095551234",
  "consultationFee": 250.00,
  "roomNumber": "Suite 101"
}

### 2. Register a Doctor (Cardiology - Case Insensitive)
# @name registerDoctor2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "licenseNumber": "MD-NJ-20491",
  "firstName": "Allison",
  "lastName": "Cameron",
  "specialty": "Cardiology",
  "email": "cameron@hospital.com",
  "phone": "+16095555678",
  "consultationFee": 180.00,
  "roomNumber": "Room 202"
}

### 3. Get Doctor by ID
# Replace {{doctorId}} with the UUID from register response
@doctorId = fb958022-f994-4e59-899e-1e46d9efd87e
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctors/{{doctorId}}

### 4. Filter Doctors by Specialty (CARDIOLOGY)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctors?specialty=CARDIOLOGY

### 5. Get All Doctors (Paginated & Sorted)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctors?page=0&size=10

### 6. Add Weekly Schedule Block for Doctor (Monday 09:00 - 12:00, 30 min slots)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctors/{{doctorId}}/schedules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dayOfWeek": "MONDAY",
  "startTime": "09:00:00",
  "endTime": "12:00:00",
  "slotDurationMinutes": 30,
  "maxPatients": 6
}

### 7. Get All Schedules for Doctor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctors/{{doctorId}}/schedules

### 8. Query Available Slots for a Specific Date
# 2026-09-21 is a Monday
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctors/{{doctorId}}/slots?date=2026-09-21

### 9. Test Overlapping Schedule Rejection (Expects HTTP 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctors/{{doctorId}}/schedules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dayOfWeek": "MONDAY",
  "startTime": "11:00:00",
  "endTime": "13:00:00",
  "slotDurationMinutes": 30,
  "maxPatients": 4
}

### 10. Test Validation Error (Expects HTTP 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "licenseNumber": "",
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "House",
  "specialty": "GENERAL_MEDICINE",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "phone": "",
  "consultationFee": -50.00
}

### 11. Test Doctor Not Found (Expects HTTP 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctors/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
